# Classes moving up and down x; the lower end feeds W, the upper end absorbs
model two_way
axis s categorical [up, down]
axis x in [0, 1] n=6
param c[s] = {up: 1, down: -2}
field B(s, x)
compartment W
d_t(B) = -d_x(c[s]*B)     using sharp
outflow B at x=lower to W
outflow B at x=upper
d_t(W) = -0.1*W
B(0) = density(normal(x, mean=0.5, sd=0.2))
